{"id":"p-need-day-off","english":"I need a day off tomorrow.","chinese":"我明天想请一天假。","explanation":"请假最常用的说法。day off 指休息一天，不说 vacation（那是长假）。","categoryIds":["factory"],"sceneIds":[],"alternatives":[{"en":"Can I take tomorrow off?","zh":"我明天能请假吗？"},{"en":"I need tomorrow off.","zh":"我明天要请假。"}],"aliases":["请假"]}